{
  "about": "K4-0 第二次交回：lite 真窗口上的动态左栏、模板集合、条目卡、刷新和重开；旧版仍用原左栏。；v3 切换后保留全部 canonical 验收步骤，旧产品回切尾段已退役。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "seed": "lite"
    },
    {
      "call": "book.list",
      "input": {},
      "save": "books"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "all": true
      },
      "save": "entries"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "save": "roots"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry_template.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "save": "templates"
    },
    {
      "launch": {
        "env": {
          "DRIFTING_APPEARANCE": "light"
        },
        "settings": {
          "device": {
            "modules": {
              "first_run.done": true,
              "guides.seen": [
                "workspace-tour"
              ]
            }
          },
          "account": {
            "language.ui_locale": "en"
          }
        }
      },
      "note": "The workspace tour comes up once on a device that has not seen it, 0.7 s after a book's workspace shows, its first bubble over the left column's Tab row and the rows under it (m24-sea.md 「导览」, kernel-v5 §15 item 50; on books of the current format since UP, 2026-11-17). This profile is fresh: the device is told it has seen the tour, as the other window scenarios do, so no bubble lies over what the steps below press."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "timeout_ms": 30000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "window.focus"
    },
    {
      "app": "book.open",
      "params": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/book/version": 5
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "action.dispatch",
      "params": {
        "name": "workspace::ToggleLeftSidebar"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/left/open": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 1200
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/v3Sidebar/tabs/0/root": true,
        "/v3Sidebar/tabs/1/mount/entry": "${roots.0.id}",
        "/v3Sidebar/tabs/2/mount/entry": "${roots.1.id}",
        "/v3Sidebar/tabs/3/mount/entry": "${roots.2.id}",
        "/v3Sidebar/tabs/4/mount/entry": "${roots.3.id}",
        "/v3Sidebar/entry": null,
        "/v3Sidebar/display": "list",
        "/v3Sidebar/registered": true
      },
      "note": "K4-0.6：项目定义里的 Tab 逐个成为标签，第一个是常驻的「全部」，新项目打开停在它上面（kernel-v5 §5）；选中的 Tab 由 G2 注册的显示画出"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "${roots.0.title}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.0.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "${roots.1.title}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.1.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "${roots.2.title}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.2.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "${roots.3.title}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.3.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "New template",
        "role": "Button"
      },
      "note": "模板集合有 K5 的新建入口；未注册创建器时禁用，委托契约由 GPUI 测试断言"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.screenshot",
      "png": "01-sidebar.png"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Skip tour",
        "absent": true
      },
      "note": "导览已看过（启动时设了 guides.seen），不再出（m24-sea.md「导览」：一台设备只出一次）"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry_template.put",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "template": {
          "id": "aaa-k4-template",
          "name": "验收模板"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "验收模板",
        "absent": true
      },
      "note": "T9：左下模板集合只有总数和入口。模板卡在铺满后的模板结构。"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "Template structure",
        "role": "Button"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "验收模板"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "Full editor",
        "role": "Button"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "template:aaa-k4-template"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry_template.delete",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "aaa-k4-template"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "验收模板",
        "absent": true
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "home"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "${templates.[id=tpl-chapter].name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "Full editor",
        "role": "Button"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "template:tpl-chapter"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "nav.open",
      "params": {
        "target": "entry:${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].parent}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "entry:${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].parent}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      },
      "note": "Opening an entry from the filled column leaves fill; the left column closes back over 420 ms (motion::STRUCTURAL) and nothing in the state says when it is over. Hover once the rows have their open width, or the pointer lands outside the row before the card shows."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.hover",
      "params": {
        "label": "${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].title}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "Open",
        "timeout_ms": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "New",
        "timeout_ms": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "Edit template",
        "timeout_ms": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "Change template",
        "timeout_ms": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "Assign to",
        "timeout_ms": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "Move to Recently Deleted",
        "timeout_ms": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.screenshot",
      "png": "02-entry-card.png",
      "note": "K4-0.7：一个公共头部、六个公共操作，扩展行的排序和回调另由 GPUI 契约验证"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "Open"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "entry:${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "nav.open",
      "params": {
        "target": "entry:${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].parent}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "entry:${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].parent}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.hover",
      "params": {
        "label": "${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].title}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "Edit template"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "template:tpl-chapter"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "nav.open",
      "params": {
        "target": "entry:${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].parent}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "entry:${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].parent}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.hover",
      "params": {
        "label": "${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].title}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "label": "Move to Recently Deleted"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "all": true
      },
      "note": "最近删除经 F3 持久命令生效",
      "expect": {
        "/[id=${entries.[template=tpl-chapter].id}]": null
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.update",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${roots.3.id}",
        "overrides": {
          "display": "grid"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/display": "grid"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.create",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "title": "验收顶层",
        "template": "tpl-group"
      },
      "save": "added"
    },
    {
      "call": "tab.put",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "mount": {
          "kind": "entry",
          "entry": "${added.id}"
        }
      },
      "save": "addedTab",
      "note": "A Tab is called by what it mounts (kernel-v5 §5; DZ dropped the tab's own name). It goes last, the seventh, past the column's edge."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "验收顶层"
      },
      "note": "Wait for the seventh Tab to be drawn before scrolling: until it is, the row still fits and there is nothing to scroll."
    },
    {
      "app": "input.scroll",
      "params": {
        "x": 200,
        "y": 56,
        "dx": 600,
        "dy": 0
      },
      "note": "A row that does not fit scrolls sideways; the manage button stays at its end (Tab prototype, T1). The bridge's dx is how far to look right (it sends the wheel the other way round), so 600 brings the seventh Tab in."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "验收顶层"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${added.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.trash",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${added.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${added.id}",
          "/v3Sidebar/selected": "${addedTab.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "StaticText",
        "label": "“验收顶层” is gone"
      },
      "note": "A Tab whose mount is gone says only that, whatever the reason (Tab prototype, T1)."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "验收顶层"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "${roots.2.title}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.2.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "app.quit"
    },
    {
      "launch": {
        "env": {
          "DRIFTING_APPEARANCE": "light"
        },
        "settings": {
          "device": {
            "modules": {
              "first_run.done": true
            }
          },
          "account": {
            "language.ui_locale": "en"
          }
        }
      },
      "note": "Same profile as the first launch: launch merges into its settings.json, so guides.seen stays and the tour stays seen."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "timeout_ms": 30000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "book.open",
      "params": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/left/open": true,
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.2.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 1200
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.screenshot",
      "png": "03-restored-sidebar.png"
    },
    {
      "app": "app.quit"
    }
  ]
}
